Gap: Module 03 and Module 08 mention FHIR but do not cover HL7 CDS Hooks and SMART on FHIR — the actual mechanism by which AI models are embedded into EHR workflows (Epic, Cerner) at the point of care.

What to add to Module 03 or 08:

SMART on FHIR: launch context, authorization, scopes, patient and provider app patterns
CDS Hooks: hook types (patient-view, order-select, order-sign), request/response anatomy
Building a CDS service: FHIR R4 resource parsing, ML score → card construction
Epic/Cerner specific integration notes (App Orchard, SMART Gallery)
